    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: card1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 130, 370, 280]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderGray"}
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000015"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: img1
    elementType: image
    bounds: [70, 140, 350, 210]
    src: "E:\\PaginasQueHice\\SIMAApp\\output\\playwright\\09-course-detail.png"
    fit:
      mode: cover
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [2000]
  - elementId: cap1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 358, 350, 40]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>Detalle de curso con clases y materiales</p>
  - elementId: card2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [450, 130, 370, 280]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderGray"}
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000015"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: img2
    elementType: image
    bounds: [460, 140, 350, 210]
    src: "E:\\PaginasQueHice\\SIMAApp\\output\\playwright\\10-course-form.png"
    fit:
      mode: cover
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [2000]
  - elementId: cap2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [460, 358, 350, 40]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>Formulario de creación de curso</p>
  - elementId: card3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 130, 370, 280]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderGray"}
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000015"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: img3
    elementType: image
    bounds: [850, 140, 350, 210]
    src: "E:\\PaginasQueHice\\SIMAApp\\output\\playwright\\ui_eval\\lesson_detail_light.png"
    fit:
      mode: cover
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [2000]
  - elementId: cap3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [850, 358, 350, 40]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>Detalle de clase con transcripción y materiales</p>
  - elementId: note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 430, 1160, 220]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>El sistema permite <strong>crear cursos</strong> con nombre, ciclo académico, temas principales y objetivo del estudiante. Cada clase subida pertenece a un curso y se procesa para generar materiales. El <strong>detalle de clase</strong> muestra el audio/video original, la transcripción completa, el resumen y acceso a los microcontenidos generados.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">Antes de procesar, el sistema verifica que el usuario tenga créditos suficientes, valida el formato del archivo y calcula el costo estimado en créditos.</p>
  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1200, 690, 60, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>10</p>
